WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.801
-Switching gears, you guys,
here's some great news.

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:05.834
After 118 days,
the Screen Actors Guild

00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:08.434
reached a deal
with the Hollywood studios.

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.501
The strike is over!

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:14.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.033
So tune in tomorrow
when my guests will be everyone.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:20.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.334
-Yes, interesting that the...

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:27.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:28.868
The guys from Please
Don't Destroy.

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:31.133
Oh, my gosh.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:34.734
Welcome.
What are you guys doing here?

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.033
Shouldn't you be up at "SNL"?

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:37.701
-Dude, I'll tell you
what we're doing here.

00:00:37.701 --> 00:00:39.267
-What?
-We were on the show
three days ago,

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:41.968
and we couldn't talk about our
movie because the actors strike.

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:44.133
-Yeah, but now it's over
and we can talk about it.

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:46.200
So why don't you book us?

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.400
-What do you mean,
why don't we book you?

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.801
You were just here.

00:00:48.801 --> 00:00:51.033
-Yeah, but we weren't able
to talk about our movie.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:53.701
"Please Don't Destroy:
The Treasure of Foggy Mountain"

00:00:53.701 --> 00:00:55.834
coming out on Peacock.
-Yeah, well...

00:00:55.834 --> 00:00:58.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:02.100
Well, you come back
and you can talk about it.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.634
-Who do you have booked tonight?
-We're fully booked.

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:06.000
We have Jared Leto
on the show tonight.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:11.767
-Well, what movie
does he have coming out?

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:13.033
-He's not talking
about a movie.

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:15.667
He's announcing a world tour
with 30 Seconds to Mars.

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:17.033
-So he's not talking about

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:18.100
"Please Don't Destroy:
The Treasure of Foggy Mountain"

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.167
coming out
November 17th on Peacock?

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:21.701
-No, he's not talking about it.

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:24.834
-Oh, okay.
-Okay. Who else is on the show?

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:27.033
-AJR is on the show tonight.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:28.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:30.400
-Ah.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.167
So AJR is going to talk about

00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:34.868
"Please Don't Destroy:
The Treasure of Foggy Mountain"

00:01:34.868 --> 00:01:37.734
coming out on peacock.com

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:40.067
November 17th?
You can sign up today.

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:43.767
-Uh, no, AJR is not going to
talk about that at all.

00:01:43.767 --> 00:01:45.367
They're a great band
and they have a new album

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:47.067
coming out tonight
at midnight actually.

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:48.534
Tonight. Yeah.
-Wow. So then...

00:01:48.534 --> 00:01:51.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.667
I mean, I just don't understand

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:54.968
how the hell anyone
is going to find out about

00:01:54.968 --> 00:01:57.634
"Please Don't Destroy:
The Treasure of Foggy Mountain,"

00:01:57.634 --> 00:02:00.300
which is coming out
November 17th on Peacock.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:04.400
-Yeah, I don't know
how that's going to happen.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.534
I'm sorry.
I'm sorry to let you down.

00:02:06.534 --> 00:02:09.334
-Okay. Alright. We're going
to go do "Seth." Um...

00:02:09.334 --> 00:02:11.601
-Wow.

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:13.033
-Before we leave,
we just want to say

00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:16.334
this audience is
the best audience in the world!

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:18.701
-Get out of here!

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:20.501
-Love you, Jimmy.

00:02:20.501 --> 00:02:21.634
-Bye, guys.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:22.968
Get out of here!

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:25.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:27.634
Get out of here.
Please Don't Destroy.

